      "text": "# This bundle's own loader layer. Applied in `dsh.profile.bundles` order, before\n# the profile's own cordis.patch.yml. A top-level array of patch entries: an\n# `insert:` list appends rows to the profile's root entry list.\n#\n# ONE row per dual-face package. client-modules keys a browser row by PACKAGE\n# NAME and reads that package's `dsh.client` + `exports[\"./client\"]`; the Loader\n# keyed by the same row imports this package's `main` for the Node half. Two rows\n# naming one package make composition fail with\n# \"package <name> resolves from multiple active Loader sources\" — so this file\n# must keep exactly one row, and the row must name the bare package (never\n# `<name>/client`).\n- insert:\n    - id: aux-chat\n      name: '@dsh-ext/dsh-plugin-auxiliary-chat'\n"
    }
